/T (Ask students to press the Play button. Ask what happens. Nothing happens. This is because we haven't programmed anything yet. We are going to do that now. Tell the students that they will be using blocks to tell the sprite exactly what to do, step by step. We place the blocks from top to bottom, like building instructions There are different types of blocks. Each kind has its own background colour. Ask for the meaning of each category:)
